    "updated_at": "2021-04-15T16:57:59Z",
    "body": "Because `fish` doesn't support nested command replacements, this is my approach for this problem, in `~/.config/fish/config.fish`:\r\n```\r\nif status --is-interactive\r\n  # Setup starship\r\n  set star (brew --prefix)/bin/starship\r\n  eval ($star init fish)\r\nend\r\n  ```",
    "author_association": "NONE",
