    "updated_at": "2021-09-03T17:00:06Z",
    "body": "> @chipbuster How would you feel about adding the [which crate](https://crates.io/crates/which) as a dependency? I'm not wild about a new dependency, but this one seems pretty small and does exactly what we're looking for, including support for Windows. I have it working locally (Linux) and it's finding the Homebrew symlinked binary.\n\nJust noticed this now but we added the which crate in an unrelated change so this might fix is even easier to add now. ",
